title Klondike: the deal number with the PDA handwriting band (portrait canvases only)
sizes 480x800 480x640 800x1280
band
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DATA o-band
env KLONDIKE_TEST_RESET 1
env KLONDIKE_TEST_DEAL 1
wait 300
key m
wait 200
key down
key enter
wait 400
expect band shown
shot band
check band
write digits 7 3
wait 200
shot written
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 200
expect band hidden
